data: {"text": "(Showing facts straight from the Pok\u00e9dex \u2014 add an LLM key for narrated answers.)\n\nJigglypuff (National Pok\u00e9dex #39) is a Normal/Fairy-type Pok\u00e9mon, the Balloon Pok\u00e9mon. Base stats \u2014 HP 115, Attack 45, Defense 20, Special Attack 45, Special Defense 25, Speed 20 (base stat total 270). Abilities: Cute Charm, Competitive, Friend Guard. It is 0.5 m tall and weighs 5.5 kg. Its habitat is grassland.. Evolves from Igglybuff via level up; Evolves into Wigglytuff using Moon Stone [1]"}

